WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.233 --> 00:00:00.900
The Kremlin

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.769
pushing back on newly declassified U.S.

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:05.071
intelligence that shows 20,000

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:06.206
Russian soldiers have been killed

00:00:06.206 --> 00:00:08.141
in Ukraine since December alone.

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:08.942
A large portion of

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:09.609
those are likely

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:10.810
private Virginia

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:11.778
mercenary fighters

00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:13.546
killed around the area of Buck Mount,

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:15.415
where you see these apocalyptic scenes

00:00:15.415 --> 00:00:16.316
we're showing you right now.

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:18.351
Despite the total destruction, Ukraine

00:00:18.351 --> 00:00:20.286
says Russia has not completely captured

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:21.321
the eastern city.

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:23.356
Now largely a symbolic goal

00:00:23.356 --> 00:00:24.924
rather than a strategic one.

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:25.492
CNN's Nick

00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:26.993
Paton Walsh is in the southern city

00:00:26.993 --> 00:00:27.427
of Zappa,

00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:28.561
Russia, Ukraine, for us right now.

00:00:28.561 --> 00:00:29.062
And Nick,

00:00:29.062 --> 00:00:29.996
British intelligence

00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:30.697
you say, shows

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:32.265
Russia is afraid

00:00:32.265 --> 00:00:33.933
Ukraine could achieve a, quote,

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:35.068
major breakthrough.

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:35.668
They're building up

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:37.604
an extensive system of trenches

00:00:37.604 --> 00:00:38.171
in the south.

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:39.672
Tell us what you're seeing

00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:42.275
you know,

00:00:42.275 --> 00:00:43.977
there has been an extraordinary network

00:00:43.977 --> 00:00:44.911
dug possibly,

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:45.812
according to this British

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:46.746
intelligence report,

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:48.148
the largest we've seen since World

00:00:48.148 --> 00:00:49.149
War Two.

00:00:49.149 --> 00:00:51.584
Across the southern area of Zacharia,

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:52.552
we've driven along

00:00:52.552 --> 00:00:54.654
the Ukrainian side of it for quite a past

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:56.322
number of weeks here.

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:58.091
Often, these are deep trenches,

00:00:58.091 --> 00:01:00.226
followed by a significant sandbank

00:01:00.226 --> 00:01:01.594
backed up with razor wire.

00:01:01.594 --> 00:01:02.762
And then these dragon's

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:03.897
teeth sort of pyramid

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:05.465
shaped pieces of concrete

00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:06.066
that form

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:08.101
a complex series of defenses,

00:01:08.101 --> 00:01:09.069
not insurmountable

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:09.602
with modern

00:01:09.602 --> 00:01:10.804
weaponry and explosives

00:01:10.804 --> 00:01:12.872
and targeted missiles at all.

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:14.107
But certainly a challenge

00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:14.974
that will be very much

00:01:14.974 --> 00:01:15.642
in the mind

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:16.976
of Ukrainian forces

00:01:16.976 --> 00:01:18.678
as they probably in the days ahead,

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:19.679
if not already in the days

00:01:19.679 --> 00:01:20.880
behind begin

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:23.483
the counter offensive in these areas.

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:24.617
We simply don't know

00:01:24.617 --> 00:01:25.552
the full details

00:01:25.552 --> 00:01:26.920
of their plan, to be honest,

00:01:26.920 --> 00:01:28.021
and whether it's

00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:29.355
potentially playing into it.

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:30.757
There's been an extraordinary

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:32.192
lack of videos

00:01:32.192 --> 00:01:33.226
from Ukrainian military

00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:34.194
over the past weeks.

00:01:34.194 --> 00:01:35.962
They normally post from the front,

00:01:35.962 --> 00:01:37.130
but those we have seen

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:37.530
have talked

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:38.298
about the mud

00:01:38.298 --> 00:01:39.866
slowing down their capacity

00:01:39.866 --> 00:01:41.668
to move around the battlefield.

00:01:41.668 --> 00:01:43.703
All, frankly, that would be advertised.

00:01:44.137 --> 00:01:45.004
But we've also heard

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:46.506
from the Ukrainian ambassador

00:01:46.506 --> 00:01:47.707
to the United Kingdom

00:01:47.707 --> 00:01:48.241
that, in fact,

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:50.043
this bad weather is playing a part,

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:52.545
but sunny one day, rainy the next.

00:01:52.545 --> 00:01:54.714
All of this plays into the broader issue

00:01:54.714 --> 00:01:55.548
here, Jake.

00:01:55.548 --> 00:01:57.750
And we are, of course, also hearing

00:01:57.750 --> 00:01:59.119
from around the city of Parma,

00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:02.989
so deeply symbolic that Russian forces

00:02:02.989 --> 00:02:04.491
there are expressing concerns

00:02:04.491 --> 00:02:06.159
about a lack of artillery shells

00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:07.594
and the possibility that might mean

00:02:07.594 --> 00:02:09.195
they have to start pulling back Jake.

00:02:09.195 --> 00:02:09.496
And Nick,

00:02:09.496 --> 00:02:10.263
we're also hearing

00:02:10.263 --> 00:02:11.431
about increased attacks

00:02:11.431 --> 00:02:12.665
and sabotage

00:02:12.665 --> 00:02:14.300
in occupied areas in the south.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:15.034
Tell us about that

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:18.338
Yes, certainly building up

00:02:18.338 --> 00:02:19.172
this broader

00:02:19.172 --> 00:02:21.241
anticipation of the counteroffensive.

00:02:21.407 --> 00:02:22.475
A number of attacks,

00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:23.176
what you might refer to

00:02:23.176 --> 00:02:24.144
as in occupied

00:02:24.144 --> 00:02:25.545
areas behind enemy

00:02:25.545 --> 00:02:27.413
lines, particularly in Malaita,

00:02:27.413 --> 00:02:28.648
a key target city

00:02:28.648 --> 00:02:29.215
for Ukraine

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:31.651
to liberate in the weeks ahead.

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:32.452
A few days ago,

00:02:32.452 --> 00:02:34.154
we heard of a police official

00:02:34.154 --> 00:02:35.555
there that was working for the Russian

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:36.756
occupying forces

00:02:36.756 --> 00:02:37.590
He was killed,

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:39.459
according to sources there.

00:02:39.459 --> 00:02:41.060
And in the last hours or so,

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:42.529
we've heard of another attempt

00:02:42.529 --> 00:02:44.197
to target an official

00:02:44.197 --> 00:02:46.833
working for the occupying Russian forces

00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:47.734
there as well.

00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:48.968
On top of that two

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:50.403
now, a number of explosions

00:02:50.403 --> 00:02:51.204
in Brian's

00:02:51.204 --> 00:02:54.240
targeting rail facilities in that area.

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:55.675
One may have been an improvised

00:02:55.675 --> 00:02:57.343
explosive device, suggestions

00:02:57.343 --> 00:02:59.145
of another potential explosion

00:02:59.145 --> 00:03:00.113
just today.

00:03:00.113 --> 00:03:01.848
So increasingly, as we head

00:03:01.848 --> 00:03:03.149
into what many believe

00:03:03.149 --> 00:03:03.883
is now the beginning

00:03:03.883 --> 00:03:05.218
of Ukraine's counteroffensive,

00:03:05.218 --> 00:03:05.785
something there have been

00:03:05.785 --> 00:03:07.720
absolutely clear they will not announce.

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:10.590
We are seeing more sabotage of targets

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:12.158
inside occupied areas Jake.

00:03:12.158 --> 00:03:12.492
All right.

00:03:12.492 --> 00:03:14.294
Nick Paton Walsh in Zappa, Russia,

00:03:14.294 --> 00:03:16.362
Ukraine for us. Thank you so much. Today.

00:03:16.362 --> 00:03:18.298
Some rare praise from the White House

00:03:18.298 --> 00:03:19.232
for Republican House Speaker

00:03:19.232 --> 00:03:19.999
Kevin McCarthy

00:03:19.999 --> 00:03:20.833
after McCarthy

00:03:20.833 --> 00:03:22.335
pushed back on a Russian reporter

00:03:22.335 --> 00:03:23.469
who asked him about, quote,

00:03:23.469 --> 00:03:24.571
not supporting

00:03:24.571 --> 00:03:26.272
unlimited aid to Ukraine

00:03:26.272 --> 00:03:28.341
during McCarthy's trip to Israel.

00:03:28.408 --> 00:03:28.942
Take a listen.

00:03:30.944 --> 00:03:32.645
I vote for aid for Ukraine.

00:03:32.645 --> 00:03:34.747
I support aid for Ukraine.

00:03:34.981 --> 00:03:35.949
I do not support

00:03:35.949 --> 00:03:36.983
what your country has done

00:03:36.983 --> 00:03:38.218
you do to Ukraine.

00:03:38.218 --> 00:03:39.352
I do not support

00:03:39.352 --> 00:03:41.187
your killing of the children. Either.

00:03:41.187 --> 00:03:43.356
And I think for one standpoint,

00:03:43.356 --> 00:03:44.657
you should pull out.

00:03:44.657 --> 00:03:46.593
And I don't think it's right.

00:03:46.593 --> 00:03:47.961
This after McCarthy repeatedly

00:03:47.961 --> 00:03:48.795
said there would be, quote,

00:03:48.795 --> 00:03:50.129
no blank check to Ukraine

00:03:50.129 --> 00:03:51.698
from his Republican majority

00:03:51.698 --> 00:03:52.632
House of Representatives.

00:03:52.632 --> 00:03:53.900
White House Press Secretary

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:55.068
Karine Jean-Pierre said

00:03:55.068 --> 00:03:56.603
she was glad to hear

00:03:56.603 --> 00:03:57.870
McCarthy swat down

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.539
that Russian propaganda.

00:03:59.539 --> 00:04:00.506
US Secretary of State

00:04:00.506 --> 00:04:02.041
Antony Blinken admitted that U.S.

00:04:02.041 --> 00:04:04.043
dialog with Russia is, quote, irregular

00:04:04.043 --> 00:04:05.111
when it comes to Americans

00:04:05.111 --> 00:04:05.645
detained there.

00:04:05.645 --> 00:04:06.212
As families

00:04:06.212 --> 00:04:07.380
and advocacy groups

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:09.182
continue to push the Biden administration

00:04:09.182 --> 00:04:10.250
for more action

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:11.251
The Bring Our Families

00:04:11.251 --> 00:04:13.119
Home campaign will hold a vigil

00:04:13.119 --> 00:04:14.454
in Washington, D.C.

00:04:14.454 --> 00:04:16.456
this evening to implore President Biden

00:04:16.723 --> 00:04:18.725
and his administration to do more

00:04:18.725 --> 00:04:20.226
to bring wrongfully detained Americans

00:04:20.226 --> 00:04:22.295
held hostage all over the world home.

00:04:22.662 --> 00:04:23.396
Ahead of the event,

00:04:23.396 --> 00:04:23.896
a billboard

00:04:23.896 --> 00:04:25.031
truck circled the White House

00:04:25.031 --> 00:04:25.798
and State Department

00:04:25.798 --> 00:04:26.599
displaying messages

00:04:26.599 --> 00:04:27.300
such as

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:28.434
protest that the president

00:04:28.434 --> 00:04:30.803
of the United States stop ignoring us.

00:04:30.803 --> 00:04:31.938
One of the attendees

00:04:31.938 --> 00:04:33.006
at tonight's vigil, U.S.

00:04:33.006 --> 00:04:33.873
Marine veteran

00:04:33.873 --> 00:04:34.607
detained in Russia

00:04:34.607 --> 00:04:35.608
for nearly three years,

00:04:35.608 --> 00:04:37.076
Trevor Reed, Trevor

00:04:37.076 --> 00:04:38.778
and his parents, Joey and Paula Reid,

00:04:38.778 --> 00:04:39.479
joins us now.

00:04:39.479 --> 00:04:41.047
And I think our viewers know

00:04:41.047 --> 00:04:42.115
you guys by now,

00:04:42.115 --> 00:04:43.316
although we're all keeping up

00:04:43.316 --> 00:04:44.550
with your various looks.

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:45.485
First, you got huge

00:04:45.485 --> 00:04:46.352
and now you got the beard.

00:04:48.087 --> 00:04:49.022
Trevor, before we get to

00:04:49.022 --> 00:04:51.824
tonight's vigil, for for over a year

00:04:52.759 --> 00:04:54.060
I'm sorry, just over a year ago,

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:54.694
you were released

00:04:54.694 --> 00:04:56.095
from the Russian prison.

00:04:56.095 --> 00:04:58.131
I want to play a part of our conversation

00:04:58.131 --> 00:04:59.198
last May

00:05:02.201 --> 00:05:05.171
when they told me that I was leaving.

00:05:05.171 --> 00:05:06.873
I thought that Paul, you know,

00:05:06.873 --> 00:05:08.675
was leaving with me

00:05:08.675 --> 00:05:11.244
and when I found out that they left him

00:05:11.244 --> 00:05:11.744
here,

00:05:13.112 --> 00:05:14.280
that was tough.

00:05:15.782 --> 00:05:17.917
You didn't want to go with him.

00:05:19.819 --> 00:05:21.554
You didn't have a choice.

00:05:21.554 --> 00:05:22.322
Trevor

00:05:24.223 --> 00:05:24.891
sorry.

00:05:25.725 --> 00:05:26.859
You didn't have a choice.

00:05:26.859 --> 00:05:28.795
There's nothing you could do

00:05:31.331 --> 00:05:31.864
Yeah,

00:05:31.864 --> 00:05:34.500
I realize that, but

00:05:35.468 --> 00:05:37.470
the fact is that

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:38.237
the United States

00:05:38.237 --> 00:05:39.572
should have got him out,

00:05:39.572 --> 00:05:43.009
and we have to get there now at any cost.

00:05:44.277 --> 00:05:44.610
First, of all,

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:46.779
I have to say, the fact that you got out

00:05:46.779 --> 00:05:47.480
and that you and

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:50.016
your family are as involved

00:05:50.016 --> 00:05:52.151
still on trying to get other people

00:05:52.151 --> 00:05:53.986
out is just remarkable.

00:05:53.986 --> 00:05:54.721
And such a testament

00:05:54.721 --> 00:05:56.756
to the character of your family.

00:05:56.756 --> 00:05:57.557
But here we are

00:05:57.557 --> 00:05:59.726
a year later, Paul Wieland still there.

00:05:59.726 --> 00:06:01.160
Now, another American,

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:02.462
Wall Street Journal reporter, Evan

00:06:02.462 --> 00:06:03.930
Miscovich, is there.

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:05.365
If you could speak right now

00:06:05.365 --> 00:06:06.132
directly to them,

00:06:06.132 --> 00:06:08.735
what would you say to those two men?

00:06:08.735 --> 00:06:10.136
I would tell them that

00:06:10.136 --> 00:06:12.238
they have to hold on and that,

00:06:12.238 --> 00:06:13.239
you know, we're fighting here

00:06:13.239 --> 00:06:14.974
and we're not going to stop

00:06:14.974 --> 00:06:16.109
until they come home

00:06:16.109 --> 00:06:17.643
and to not give up

00:06:17.643 --> 00:06:19.746
and to keep making noise.

00:06:20.346 --> 00:06:21.481
How are you doing?

00:06:21.481 --> 00:06:22.348
It's been a year.

00:06:22.348 --> 00:06:24.484
You've been out of prison.

00:06:24.484 --> 00:06:25.351
How's everything?

00:06:25.351 --> 00:06:26.486
I'm doing really well.

00:06:26.486 --> 00:06:27.019
Yeah.

00:06:27.019 --> 00:06:27.286
Yeah,

00:06:27.286 --> 00:06:28.588
it takes a couple

00:06:28.588 --> 00:06:29.956
of months to kind of adjust.

00:06:31.491 --> 00:06:32.291
But then after that,

00:06:32.291 --> 00:06:33.826
you just kind of go back

00:06:33.826 --> 00:06:35.962
to doing what you were before and

00:06:35.962 --> 00:06:37.230
and fitting back into things.

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:38.097
So that's good.

00:06:38.097 --> 00:06:38.698
Well, you look great.

00:06:38.698 --> 00:06:39.198
And your parents

00:06:39.198 --> 00:06:40.333
look ten years

00:06:40.333 --> 00:06:42.068
younger than last time I saw them.

00:06:42.068 --> 00:06:43.636
Oh, that's the makeup.

00:06:43.669 --> 00:06:44.971
No, it's not.

00:06:44.971 --> 00:06:46.239
So Joey and Paula

00:06:46.239 --> 00:06:47.607
the Bring Our Family's Home campaigns

00:06:47.607 --> 00:06:48.674
vigil and rallies.

00:06:48.674 --> 00:06:50.176
Goal is to get President Biden

00:06:50.176 --> 00:06:50.576
to meet

00:06:50.576 --> 00:06:51.911
with the detained American families

00:06:51.911 --> 00:06:53.346
and not just the ones

00:06:53.346 --> 00:06:53.980
that are,

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:54.981
quote unquote, famous,

00:06:54.981 --> 00:06:57.483
not just the ones that are notable.

00:06:57.483 --> 00:06:59.886
I want to play a part of lead U.S.

00:06:59.886 --> 00:07:02.021
hostage envoy Roger Carstens.

00:07:02.755 --> 00:07:04.323
On Christiane Amanpour Show.

00:07:04.323 --> 00:07:04.824
When asked

00:07:04.824 --> 00:07:06.259
why Biden wouldn't meet with families

00:07:06.259 --> 00:07:06.759
of less

00:07:06.759 --> 00:07:08.861
famous detained Americans, take a look

00:07:11.097 --> 00:07:11.864
we've brought back

00:07:11.864 --> 00:07:16.035
27 Americans in 27 months of that number.

00:07:16.035 --> 00:07:18.337
Only two of those families met

00:07:18.337 --> 00:07:19.672
with the president.

00:07:19.672 --> 00:07:21.240
So there were 25 Americans

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:23.109
that were brought home in the last over

00:07:23.109 --> 00:07:24.177
two years

00:07:24.177 --> 00:07:25.144
whose families never met

00:07:25.144 --> 00:07:26.712
with the president of the United States.

00:07:26.712 --> 00:07:28.548
The real measure of success

00:07:28.548 --> 00:07:30.416
is whether someone comes home

00:07:30.416 --> 00:07:31.951
stops on the tarmac on U.S.

00:07:31.951 --> 00:07:33.186
soil and falls

00:07:33.186 --> 00:07:34.654
into the loving arms of their family.

00:07:34.654 --> 00:07:35.354
That's the metric

00:07:35.354 --> 00:07:36.289
that we're shooting for.

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:37.790
And I know

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:39.392
you you love Roger Carstens,

00:07:39.392 --> 00:07:41.093
and he's he's an American hero.

00:07:41.093 --> 00:07:42.094
Did this job for Trump

00:07:42.094 --> 00:07:43.329
doing it with Biden.

00:07:43.329 --> 00:07:45.364
All praise to him at the time.

00:07:45.364 --> 00:07:46.165
We should know

00:07:46.165 --> 00:07:47.934
your family was the only family.

00:07:47.934 --> 00:07:50.336
Other detainee held in Russia

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:51.904
to have met with President Biden.

00:07:51.904 --> 00:07:53.072
Do you think that actually made

00:07:53.072 --> 00:07:54.240
a difference?

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:55.141
There's no doubt

00:07:55.141 --> 00:07:55.675
there's

00:07:55.675 --> 00:07:57.510
we said for a year and a half

00:07:57.510 --> 00:07:58.845
before that meeting.

00:07:58.845 --> 00:08:00.980
We just need to get through

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:02.281
the bureaucracy

00:08:02.281 --> 00:08:04.383
to the man who makes the decisions.

00:08:04.383 --> 00:08:05.551
And once he hears

00:08:05.551 --> 00:08:06.752
about our son personally

00:08:06.752 --> 00:08:08.221
and what he's going through,

00:08:08.221 --> 00:08:09.489
that he will make it happen.

00:08:09.489 --> 00:08:12.325
And 27 days later, Trevor was a free man.

00:08:12.592 --> 00:08:13.659
And you heard President Biden

00:08:13.659 --> 00:08:15.094
the other night saying something,

00:08:15.094 --> 00:08:16.395
talking about this issue. Right.

00:08:16.395 --> 00:08:17.763
And the thing was, like you said,

00:08:17.763 --> 00:08:19.532
a more famous people or whatever,

00:08:19.532 --> 00:08:20.299
we weren't famous.

00:08:20.299 --> 00:08:21.701
We're just regular people.

00:08:21.701 --> 00:08:22.502
But I think it was

00:08:22.502 --> 00:08:24.437
because we just never let up

00:08:24.437 --> 00:08:25.771
and we just kept going

00:08:25.771 --> 00:08:26.472
and going and going.

00:08:26.472 --> 00:08:27.840
And then after that happened

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:28.774
and because the president

00:08:28.774 --> 00:08:30.176
is a compassionate person,

00:08:30.176 --> 00:08:31.043
he could see the pain

00:08:31.043 --> 00:08:32.078
in our family's eyes

00:08:32.078 --> 00:08:33.946
from not having Trevor with us.

00:08:33.946 --> 00:08:35.815
And he decided to do something about it.

00:08:35.815 --> 00:08:36.983
So you think it made a difference?

00:08:36.983 --> 00:08:38.551
Do you think it was a difference

00:08:38.551 --> 00:08:40.620
between President Biden saying, well,

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:42.288
I don't know about that swap

00:08:42.288 --> 00:08:43.189
and President Biden saying,

00:08:43.189 --> 00:08:45.391
just do this for the. Absolutely.

00:08:45.658 --> 00:08:46.325
Yeah, it was

00:08:46.325 --> 00:08:47.460
it was a combination of things,

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:48.594
but absolutely

00:08:48.594 --> 00:08:48.995
there is

00:08:48.995 --> 00:08:50.062
that personal,

00:08:50.062 --> 00:08:51.163
personal issue,

00:08:51.163 --> 00:08:52.431
you know, with the president wanting

00:08:52.431 --> 00:08:53.966
wanting to do the right thing.

00:08:53.966 --> 00:08:56.168
And we also we're here

00:08:56.402 --> 00:08:57.503
to employ the president

00:08:57.503 --> 00:08:59.805
to meet with the families,

00:08:59.805 --> 00:09:00.573
especially the ones

00:09:00.573 --> 00:09:01.274
that are here in town.

00:09:01.274 --> 00:09:02.975
I mean, he can meet with the group.

00:09:02.975 --> 00:09:03.843
And it would be

00:09:03.843 --> 00:09:04.410
it would be

00:09:04.410 --> 00:09:06.579
even though it would not be individual.

00:09:06.579 --> 00:09:07.079
But at least

00:09:07.079 --> 00:09:08.214
even if they just had a minute

00:09:08.214 --> 00:09:09.515
or two with the president

00:09:09.515 --> 00:09:11.517
so he could put a face with the name.

00:09:11.884 --> 00:09:13.152
And it would be a great thing

00:09:13.152 --> 00:09:13.920
for the president.

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:14.987
I know he'd love to do it.

00:09:14.987 --> 00:09:15.988
And, you know,

00:09:15.988 --> 00:09:17.590
it would help him politically if nothing

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:18.491
else, but.

00:09:18.491 --> 00:09:19.659
Trevor, you told me last year

00:09:19.659 --> 00:09:20.092
that you thought

00:09:20.092 --> 00:09:21.160
before you travel to Russia,

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:23.029
there was no way that Russia would detain

00:09:23.029 --> 00:09:23.930
another American like

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:24.997
they had Paul Wieland,

00:09:26.132 --> 00:09:28.568
and that would make Russia, you know?

00:09:28.568 --> 00:09:29.335
Now they've done it again

00:09:29.335 --> 00:09:30.970
with Chris Kovac.

00:09:30.970 --> 00:09:31.871
You said it would make Russia

00:09:31.871 --> 00:09:32.738
like North Korea.

00:09:32.738 --> 00:09:33.272
In your words,

00:09:33.272 --> 00:09:35.441
it is no American safe in Russia,

00:09:35.441 --> 00:09:37.476
do you think? No.

00:09:37.476 --> 00:09:39.645
I mean, when I said that things

00:09:40.079 --> 00:09:40.646
with Russia

00:09:40.646 --> 00:09:42.782
hadn't really escalated to the point

00:09:42.782 --> 00:09:43.649
that they're out now,

00:09:43.649 --> 00:09:45.985
but I think that it's

00:09:46.686 --> 00:09:49.622
you know, extremely clear that

00:09:49.622 --> 00:09:51.223
that right now

00:09:51.223 --> 00:09:53.125
any American that travels to Russia

00:09:53.125 --> 00:09:55.394
is in grave danger of of being

00:09:55.895 --> 00:09:56.829
taken hostage

00:09:56.829 --> 00:09:57.863
by by Russia, of

00:09:57.863 --> 00:10:00.566
being wrongfully detained.

00:10:00.633 --> 00:10:01.434
And I think that

00:10:01.434 --> 00:10:03.235
that amount of desperation

00:10:03.235 --> 00:10:04.604
that the Russians have right now

00:10:04.604 --> 00:10:06.105
is going to continue to mount

00:10:06.105 --> 00:10:08.007
until eventually,

00:10:08.007 --> 00:10:09.141
maybe even diplomats

00:10:09.141 --> 00:10:10.743
are going to be at risk of that.

00:10:10.743 --> 00:10:12.278
So what we're going to continue

00:10:12.278 --> 00:10:13.379
to cover the story

00:10:13.379 --> 00:10:15.481
of all those Americans held

00:10:15.481 --> 00:10:17.984
and detained unfairly, unjustly abroad.

00:10:17.984 --> 00:10:18.951
And honestly,

00:10:18.951 --> 00:10:20.219
you three are

00:10:20.219 --> 00:10:21.153
you're one of the reasons

00:10:21.153 --> 00:10:22.922
that we all continue to do it.

00:10:22.922 --> 00:10:24.023
So thank you so much.

00:10:24.023 --> 00:10:25.191
Thank you for continuing to do it,

00:10:25.191 --> 00:10:27.093
because it means a lot to the family.

00:10:27.093 --> 00:10:28.561
We couldn't have done what we did

00:10:28.561 --> 00:10:29.629
without people like you.

00:10:29.629 --> 00:10:30.363
Well, though,

00:10:30.363 --> 00:10:30.730
I guess

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:32.565
I'm just glad that you get to get him

00:10:32.565 --> 00:10:34.300
to kiss. Yes, I do.

00:10:34.300 --> 00:10:35.901
Trevor, Joey and Paula, thanks so much.

00:10:35.901 --> 00:10:36.035
Coming.

